EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:03CD}}Sometimes in life,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} there are things
that make you so sad, you forget
exactly why you're so sad.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:03CD}}En esta vida,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} a veces hay cosas
que te ponen tan triste{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} que hasta
se te olvida por qué estás triste.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:03CD}}Parfois,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} la vie te rend si triste que
tu sais même plus pourquoi tu es
triste.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:03CD}}Certe cose mi rendono{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} così triste 
che a un certo punto non ricordo
neanche più perché sono così triste.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000D:0004:03CD}}Hayatta bazen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} insanı neden
üzgün olduğunu bile unutturacak kadar
üzen şeyler olur.{{TAG:000D:0005:}}
